# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# Eikonal variant: eikonalSolver + eikonalSolver1D.
#
# The eikonal myocardium domain overrides the case time controls
# (eikonalMyocardiumDomain::applyModelTimeControls) and solves a single
# steady boundary-value problem, so the run writes exactly one time
# directory, 1/, whatever endTime says. Sample that.
#
probe  postProcessing/injectionProbe/0/activationTime  1      2  0.0058399     1e-4
probe  postProcessing/eikonalECG.dat                   0.025  5  0.003966149   2e-4
probe  postProcessing/eikonalECG.dat                   0.035  3  -0.006853826  2e-4
probe  postProcessing/eikonalECG.dat                   0.04   7  0.006916027   2e-4
